      "text": "MUSEROOM — comic / neobrutalist UI\nTop row: first run and the daily loop. Bottom row: the social half.\nEvery screen carries a Dark switch in the chips above it. Three ship dark so both skins are on screen at once." },
    { "id": "press-note", "page": "page-1", "x": 1880, "y": 1000, "w": 340,
